    "id": "doc_76f97654b6",
    "text": "Worthy Park is one of the most popular places to play pickleball in Huntington Beach, CA. There are 4 outdoor concrete courts. These are dedicated courts with permanent lines and nets. The courts are free. The courts cannot be reserved. Players have access to restrooms, water, and lights.\n1831 17th Street, Huntington Beach, CA 92648, USA\n(714) 536-5486\nwww.surfcityusa.com",
