    "id": "doc_0a9240ba09",
    "text": "PowerPlay Pickleball is one of the most popular places to play pickleball in Gardena, CA. There are 9 indoor concrete courts. These are dedicated courts with permanent lines and nets. Players have access to food, restrooms, water, youth programming, lights, a pro shop, trainers or lessons, wheelchair accessibility, and adaptive programming. The courts can be reserved. A one-time fee is required to play.",
