  {
    "id": "doc_b065d90b40",
    "text": "Fountain Valley Recreation Center & Sports Park is one of the most popular places to play pickleball in Fountain Valley, CA. There are 16 outdoor hard and concrete courts. These are dedicated courts with permanent lines and nets. Amenities include lights, water, trainers or lessons, youth programming, and wheelchair accessibility. A one-time fee is required to play. Reservations are available. No drop in play, no open play. 16 permanent nets & courts. Reservations: court fee $12/9 (senior) per hour, two hour max, two court maximum",
    "metadata": {
